  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "# Changelog\n\n## 10.0.0.6-Beta-02 - 2026-10-24\n\n- (Revert to AMS feature)Nest validation error JSON as error.code, error.message, and error.details\n\n## 10.0.0.6-Beta-03 - 2026-10-25\n\n- Fix single level error of validationException(message) so all 400 errors comes inside details\n\n## 10.0.0.6-Beta-01 - 2026-10-23\n\n- Nest validation error JSON as error.code, error.message, and error.details\n\n## 10.0.0.5 - 2026-10-16 \n- AMS feature renamed back to AMS360\n\n## 2026-10-16 - 10.0.0.4-Beta-05\n- Added new method ValidateApiAppKeyCredentialsAsync in IApiCredentialValidatorService interface\n\n## 2026-10-16 - 10.0.0.4-Beta-04\n- Added Common Constants and AppKeyRequiredException\n\n## 2026-10-15 - 10.0.0.4-Beta-03\n- Added Support for Capture Failed Transaction Status\n\n## 2026-10-06 - 10.0.0.4-Beta-02\n- Modify error message \"Invalid routing number.\"\n\n\n## 2026-10-06 - 10.0.0.4-Beta-01\n-Added Sonar Issue fix\n\n## 2026-10-06 - 10.0.0.3-Beta-03\n\n- Added BindRabbit Feature\n\n## 2026-09-10 - 10.0.0.3-Beta-01\n\n- renamed AMS360 to AMS\n\n\n## 10.0.0.4 - 2026-10-15 \n- Modify error message \"Invalid routing number.\"\n\n\n## 10.0.0.3 - 2026-10-08 \n\n- renamed AMS360 to AMS\n\n## 10.0.0.2 - 2026-08-24\n\n- .net10 migration including github actions\n\n## 8.0.0.25 - 2026-08-20\n\n- Added shared cache serialization, validation, expiration handling, and structured operation logging.",
